---
import {slogan,t,url,type Locale} from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
interface Props {locale:Locale;}
const {locale}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="home-hero"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span>{t(['为每一个想把想法做出来的人','FOR PEOPLE WITH AN IDEA'],locale)}</div><h1>{locale==='zh-cn'?<>AI 时代，即使零基础不懂代码，<br/>也能 <span class="nowrap">Vibe Coding。</span></>:t(slogan,locale)}</h1><p class="lead">{t(['不必先学会代码。先讲清你想做什么，再和 AI 一起，把一个小想法变成能用的产品。','You don’t need to learn code first. Start with a clear idea, work with AI, and turn one small idea into something useful.'],locale)}</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={url(locale,'start')}>{t(['找到我的起点','Find my starting point'],locale)}<Icon name="arrow"/></a><a class="button" href={url(locale,'projects/web')}>{t(['从第一个网站开始','Build my first website'],locale)}</a></div><div class="hero-process"><span><b>01</b>{t(['说清想法','Describe it'],locale)}</span><Icon name="arrow"/><span><b>02</b>{t(['做出小版本','Build small'],locale)}</span><Icon name="arrow"/><span><b>03</b>{t(['亲手检查','Try it out'],locale)}</span></div></section>
<section class="section home-lesson">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT CLEAR</span><h2>{t(['同一个想法，换个说法，AI 更容易做对。','The same idea. A clearer request. A better starting point.'],locale)}</h2></div></div>
  <p class="muted">{t(['不需要堆专业名词。把“给谁用、做什么、先不做什么、怎样算做好”讲清楚。','Skip the jargon. Explain who it is for, what it should do, what can wait, and how you will check it.'],locale)}</p>
  <div class="prompt-comparison">
    <div class="vague-request"><span class="eyebrow">{t(['只有一个想法','THE INITIAL IDEA'],locale)}</span><blockquote>{t(['“帮我做一个好看的个人网站。”','“Build me a nice personal website.”'],locale)}</blockquote><p>{t(['AI 还不知道：给谁看？放什么？访客看完该做什么？','AI still needs to know: Who will visit? What belongs on it? What should visitors do next?'],locale)}</p><div class="lesson-principle"><Icon name="message"/><span>{t(['先补充目的，再讨论样子。','Explain the purpose before the appearance.'],locale)}</span></div></div>
    <div class="clear-request"><div class="prompt-heading"><span><Icon name="check"/>{t(['可以开始执行的需求','A request AI can act on'],locale)}</span><button class="button small-button" id="copy-home-prompt" data-success={t(['已复制，替换成你的资料后再发送。','Copied. Replace the details with your own before sending.'],locale)} data-failure={t(['复制失败，请手动选中文字。','Could not copy. Please select the text manually.'],locale)}><Icon name="copy" size={14}/>{t(['复制提示词','Copy prompt'],locale)}</button></div><div id="home-prompt"><p><b>{t(['给谁用','Who it is for'],locale)}</b>{t(['我要做一个个人作品站，给潜在合作方看。','I want a personal portfolio for potential collaborators.'],locale)}</p><p><b>{t(['第一版做什么','What to build first'],locale)}</b>{t(['介绍我、展示三件作品、提供联系入口。先不做登录、付费和博客。','Introduce me, show three projects, and offer a contact option. Leave out sign-in, payments, and a blog.'],locale)}</p><p><b>{t(['怎样算做好','How to check it'],locale)}</b>{t(['手机上能看清内容，访客能打开作品并找到联系方式。请先列出页面安排和我需要准备的资料，再开始制作。','It should be readable on a phone, with working project links and easy-to-find contact details. Before building, outline the page and tell me what materials to prepare.'],locale)}</p></div></div>
  </div><p id="home-copy-status" role="status" class="small muted"></p>
</section>
<section class="starter-feature section"><div class="starter-story"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST SMALL WIN</span><h2>{t(['先做一个你真的用得上的作品。','Make something you will actually use.'],locale)}</h2><p>{t(['从个人作品站开始：内容由你决定，第一版范围容易说清，完成后可以直接分享。','Start with a portfolio: you know the content, the first version is easy to define, and the result is easy to share.'],locale)}</p><a class="text-link" href={url(locale,'projects/web')}>{t(['跟着路线做第一个网站','Follow the website guide'],locale)}<Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><div class="starter-deliverables"><span class="eyebrow">{t(['你的第一版，只需要','YOUR FIRST VERSION NEEDS'],locale)}</span><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>{t(['一句话介绍自己','A one-sentence introduction'],locale)}</strong><p>{t(['让访客知道你是谁、能帮上什么忙。','Tell visitors who you are and how you can help.'],locale)}</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>{t(['三件值得展示的作品','Three projects worth sharing'],locale)}</strong><p>{t(['每件作品说明：解决什么问题、你做了什么。','Explain the problem each project solves and your role.'],locale)}</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>{t(['一个清楚的联系入口','One clear way to get in touch'],locale)}</strong><p>{t(['自己点一次，确认访客真的能联系到你。','Try it yourself to check that visitors can reach you.'],locale)}</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHEN YOU GET STUCK</span><h2>{t(['卡住时，先做这一件事。','Stuck? Try this next.'],locale)}</h2></div><span class="small muted">{t(['展开就能用','Open and put it to use'],locale)}</span></div><div class="home-faq">
<details><summary><Icon name="layout"/><strong>{t(['“不好看”，但说不清要改哪里','“It looks wrong,” but you can’t explain why'],locale)}</strong><Icon name="chevron"/></summary><div><p>{t(['截下具体区域，选一个最明显的差别：文字大小、间距、颜色或排列。一次只改一项，方便看出有没有变好。','Capture the specific area and identify one difference: text size, spacing, color, or arrangement. Change one thing at a time so you can judge the result.'],locale)}</p><blockquote>{t(['“请只调整这张卡片：标题更突出，说明文字弱一些，内容之间多留一点空隙。保持按钮位置和其他区域不变，先给我看这一处。”','“Please adjust only this card: make the heading more prominent, the description less prominent, and add more space between items. Keep the button position and other areas unchanged. Show me this change first.”'],locale)}</blockquote><p class="small muted">{t(['卡片 · Card：把一组相关内容放在一起的界面区域。','Card: a distinct area of an interface that groups related content.'],locale)}</p></div></details>
<details><summary><Icon name="help"/><strong>{t(['按钮点了没反应，不知道怎么问','A button does nothing, and you don’t know what to ask'],locale)}</strong><Icon name="chevron"/></summary><div><p>{t(['把操作顺序、你期待的结果和实际看到的结果一起告诉 AI。附上报错原文或截图，先遮住密码和个人资料。','Tell AI the steps you took, the result you expected, and what actually happened. Include the exact error or a screenshot, with passwords and personal details removed.'],locale)}</p><blockquote>{t(['“我在首页点击‘保存’，期待看到保存成功的提示，实际没有任何变化。请先找出原因，说明你准备改哪里，再修复；完成后告诉我怎样重复检查。”','“On the home page I clicked Save. I expected a success message, but nothing changed. Please find the cause, explain what you plan to change, then fix it. Tell me how to repeat the check afterward.”'],locale)}</blockquote></div></details>
<details><summary><Icon name="layers"/><strong>{t(['AI 越做越复杂，离最初想法越来越远','AI keeps adding things you never asked for'],locale)}</strong><Icon name="chevron"/></summary><div><p>{t(['暂停新增功能，重新列出这一版必须完成的一条使用流程。让 AI 把额外建议留到以后。','Pause new features and restate the one flow this version must support. Ask AI to save extra suggestions for later.'],locale)}</p><blockquote>{t(['“先暂停新增功能。这一版只需要‘打开页面 → 查看作品 → 找到联系方式’。请列出还没走通的部分，只完成这些；其他建议单独记录，暂不实现。”','“Pause new features. This version only needs: open the page → view a project → find contact details. List what still fails in that flow and finish only those parts. Record other suggestions separately for later.”'],locale)}</blockquote><p class="small muted">{t(['范围 · Scope：这一版明确要做和暂时不做的事情。','Scope: what this version will include, and what it will leave out.'],locale)}</p></div></details>
</div></section>
<script>
document.getElementById('copy-home-prompt')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{
 const button=document.getElementById('copy-home-prompt')!;
 const text=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#home-prompt p')).map(p=>Array.from(p.childNodes).map(node=>node.textContent).join(': ')).join('\n\n');
 try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);document.getElementById('home-copy-status')!.textContent=button.dataset.success!;}
 catch{document.getElementById('home-copy-status')!.textContent=button.dataset.failure!;}
});
</script>
